-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Rambo: First Blood II
  Publisher   Ocean, 1985
  Version     1.1

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Rambo - First Blood Part II (1985)(Ocean).z80
  MD5         3eb7a65e19c9ffa82a49654d31a41886

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Colours     Default (the game's own) plus: Enhanced, chosen on the menu, off
              by default.
  Enhanced    Figures in fuller colour with black outlines, and a dirt ground
              layer behind the jungle that scrolls with the terrain. A painted
              set, colourist not named.

  Changes     1.1: the hooks hand back the CPU speed the game was running at,
              instead of always dropping to 3.5 MHz

  Note        Known issues: when you board the helicopter, its rotor tips are
              drawn where they belong, where the original wraps them onto the
              next row (a small difference from the original). Missing: pace
              against the original not measured like for like: the game has no
              frame sync and keeps interrupts off, so a run parts from the
              original's within a few updates; such runs scattered from -4.7%
              to +2.2% (JNext, 2026-11-07), and against 1.0 this version
              measured +0.8%; the cheats are unplayed by a person; not reached
              in testing: the prison camp and several enemy types; hardware
              untested.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  Immunity
   3  No enemy
   4  All weapons

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

